    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/a99cf266a3c040aca9e062a3ec3766f1.webp?t=1754778799\" width=761 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/f8da0b4d62bd860e8d0751f619dbcaa0.avif?t=1754778799\" data-has-big width=800 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2193 Get first-hand information about [The Lost Realm of the Back Room] here \u2193</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youtube\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiktok\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mails: <a href=\"mailto:wf66857773@gmail.com\">wf66857773@gmail.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/98d6f3c91bb5ed65345b1c6828ff01e5.webp?t=1754778799\" width=761 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a [Puzzle game] + [escape room] Backrooms game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by 7 teenagers who love the backrooms culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/095ca9a1b1ac7124de60d6e96bd276cb.poster.avif?t=1754778799\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/095ca9a1b1ac7124de60d6e96bd276cb.webm?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/095ca9a1b1ac7124de60d6e96bd276cb.mp4?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/bc87aa47127e5505bb230bcec64e447b.webp?t=1754778799\" width=761 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of missing persons occurred in New York City, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which attracted the attention of the FBI. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FBI agent Tommy Sanderson was investigating a missing little girl </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unfortunately fell into the backroom Level 0. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/39e52f82212ad7f94ff2f5979a8192df.poster.avif?t=1754778799\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/39e52f82212ad7f94ff2f5979a8192df.webm?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/39e52f82212ad7f94ff2f5979a8192df.mp4?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/5f42a16e7f1dfd63cf2e0c93c01427d6.webp?t=1754778799\" width=761 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes 6 levels, including Level 0~5 and Level Fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is large and designed to be more difficult than the previous level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has different puzzles and mechanisms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also secret levels that will take you to the secret ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/4ac386707e48ac518ca4f967ce2368ed.poster.avif?t=1754778799\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/4ac386707e48ac518ca4f967ce2368ed.webm?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/4ac386707e48ac518ca4f967ce2368ed.mp4?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/d0f7a90341a1a71fcdee3f95b93b104c.webp?t=1754778799\" width=761 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains randomly generated mazes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you re-enter the game , </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the maze terrain in some areas will change randomly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have different gaming experience every time when you re-start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/87fe9a5a2aa4783a9669a2dd324f02d6.poster.avif?t=1754778799\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/87fe9a5a2aa4783a9669a2dd324f02d6.webm?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/87fe9a5a2aa4783a9669a2dd324f02d6.mp4?t=1754778799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
